content.text:
The degradation traces back to one injected fault: ts-travel-service holds its POST calls to ts-seat-service for about 3 s each. That delay propagates up the call chain to the user-facing dashboard.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name AS caller, c.span_name, s.service_name AS callee, s.span_name AS callee_span, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.5) client_p50_ms, approx_quantile(s.duration/1e6,0.5) server_p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id = c.span_id AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' WHERE c.service_name='ts-travel-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY n DESC", "claim": "Travel's POST to seat-service takes ~2988ms at client, while seat's server span is ~15ms, same as normal."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5) p50_ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name='POST' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Normal-period travel POST client spans have p50 about 18ms, so the ~3s delay is new."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "WITH q AS (SELECT span_id, duration FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' AND span_name='TravelController.queryInfo'), ch AS (SELECT parent_span_id pid, count(*) n_child, sum(duration) child_sum FROM abnormal_traces WHERE parent_span_id IN (SELECT span_id FROM q) GROUP BY 1) SELECT q.duration/1e6 parent_ms, ch.n_child, ch.child_sum/1e6 child_ms FROM q LEFT JOIN ch ON ch.pid=q.span_id ORDER BY parent_ms DESC LIMIT 10", "claim": "queryInfo takes ~18s, made of seven sequential ~3s POST calls to seat-service."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name, c.span_name, s.service_name AS callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.5) p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' WHERE c.service_name='ts-travel-service' AND c.attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Travel's other outgoing calls (GET to route, POST to basic) stay at normal latency, so the slowness is path-specific."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-travel-service", "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name caller, c.span_name, s.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.5) client_p50_ms, sum(CASE WHEN c.attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) client_err FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' WHERE c.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND s.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Route-plan's POSTs to travel-service rise to ~6-18s with 500 errors, versus ~80ms normally."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-plan-service", "to": "ts-travel-plan-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name caller, s.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.5) client_p50_ms, sum(CASE WHEN c.attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) client_err FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' WHERE c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND s.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Travel-plan's POSTs to route-plan take ~15s with errors, inheriting the upstream delay."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95) p95_ms, sum(CASE WHEN attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) errs FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-ui-dashboard','ts-travel-plan-service') AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND span_name LIKE '%travelPlan%' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "User-facing travelPlan requests at the dashboard are ~18s p95, matching travel-plan server spans."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-service", "to": "ts-preserve-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name caller, s.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.95) client_p95_ms, approx_quantile(s.duration/1e6,0.95) server_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' WHERE c.service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND s.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Preserve's calls into travel-service run multi-second at the p95 during the incident."}]},
    {"from": "ts-preserve-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name caller, s.service_name callee, count(*) n, approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.95) client_p95_ms, sum(CASE WHEN c.attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) client_err FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces s ON s.parent_span_id=c.span_id AND s.attr_span_kind='Server' WHERE c.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND s.service_name='ts-preserve-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Dashboard's calls to preserve-service show multi-second p95 and some errors during the incident."}]}
  ]
}
```

